    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base class the register layout classes for peripheral_base_minres must derive from. <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>derived_t</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Type of the concrete register class. Used for CRTP. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>use_URID</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Set this to true if the bitfield/register layout is not the same as the original. If true, then register lookups work by urid and not by regname and bitfield name. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
